isional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019:m0061","surface":"文才","start":61,"end":63,"kind":"person","person_id":"a5y_cwu_fmp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019:m0152","surface":"軫","start":152,"end":153,"kind":"person","person_id":"a5y_cwu_fmp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019:m0296","surface":"軫","start":296,"end":297,"kind":"person","person_id":"a5y_cwu_fmp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-046-sun-jian:p019","text":"英雄記曰：「初堅討董卓，到梁縣之陽人。卓亦遣兵歩騎五千迎之，陳郡太守胡軫爲大督護，呂布爲騎督，其餘歩騎將校都督者甚衆。軫字文才，性急，預宣言曰：『今此行也，要當斬一靑綬，乃整齊耳。』諸將聞而惡之。軍到廣成，去陽人城數十里。日暮，士馬疲極，當止宿，又本受卓節度宿廣成，秣馬飲食，以夜進兵，投曉攻城。諸將惡憚軫，欲賊敗其事，布等宣言『陽人城中賊已走，當追尋之；不然失之矣』，便夜進軍。城中守備甚設，不可掩襲。於是吏士飢渴，人馬甚疲，且夜至，又無塹壘。釋甲休息，而布又宣言相驚，云「城中賊出來」。軍衆擾亂奔走，皆棄甲，失鞍馬。行十餘里，定無賊，會天明，便還，拾取兵器，欲進攻城。城守已固，穿塹已深，軫等不能攻而還。」","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":23,"last_line":23,"raw_start":7389,"raw_end":8020,"raw_character_offsets":[7406,7407,7408,7413,7414,7415,7416,7430,7433,7447,7448,7451,7452,7466,7467,7470,7484,7485,7488,7502,7505,7506,7507,7508,7509,7510,7511,7512,7513,7514,7528,7529,7532,7533,7547,7548,7551,7552,7553,7554,7555,7569,7570,7573,7574,7575,7576,7577,7578,7579,7580,7581,7582,7583,7584,7585,7586,7587,7588,7602,7605,7619,7622,7627,7628,7629,7630,7631,7632,7633,7634,7635,7636,7637,7638,7639,7640,7641,764